{"id":"torrey:fountains-and-springs","source":"torrey","name":"Fountains And Springs","slug":"fountains-and-springs","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Created by God — Ps 74:15; 104:10.","refs":[["Ps",74,15,74,15],["Ps",104,10,104,10]]},{"text":"God to be praised for — Re 14:7.","refs":[["Rev",14,7,14,7]]},{"text":"Come from the great deep — Ge 7:11; Job 38:16.","refs":[["Gen",7,11,7,11],["Job",38,16,38,16]]},{"text":"Found in hills and valleys — De 8:7; Ps 104:10.","refs":[["Deut",8,7,8,7],["Ps",104,10,104,10]]},{"text":"Send forth each but one kind of water — Jas 3:11.","refs":[["Jas",3,11,3,11]]},{"text":"Drink to the beasts. — Ps 104:11.","refs":[["Ps",104,11,104,11]]},{"text":"Refreshment to the birds. — Ps 104:12.","refs":[["Ps",104,12,104,12]]},{"text":"Fruitfulness to the earth. — 1Ki 18:5; Joe 3:18.","refs":[["1Kgs",18,5,18,5],["Joel",3,18,3,18]]},{"text":"Frequented by travellers — Ge 16:7.","refs":[["Gen",16,7,16,7]]},{"text":"Abound in Canaan — De 8:7; 1Ki 18:5.","refs":[["Deut",8,7,8,7],["1Kgs",18,5,18,5]]},{"text":"Sometimes dried up — Isa 58:11.","refs":[["Isa",58,11,58,11]]},{"text":"Drying up of, a severe punishment — Ps 107:33,34; Ho 13:15.","refs":[["Ps",107,33,107,33],["Ps",107,34,107,34],["Hos",13,15,13,15]]},{"text":"Especially esteemed. — Isa 58:11.","refs":[["Isa",58,11,58,11]]},{"text":"Could not be ceremonially defiled. — Le 11:36.","refs":[["Lev",11,36,11,36]]},{"text":"Sometimes stopped or turned off to distress enemies — 2Ch 32:3,4.","refs":[["2Chr",32,3,32,3],["2Chr",32,4,32,4]]},{"text":"In the way to Shur. — Ge 16:7.","refs":[["Gen",16,7,16,7]]},{"text":"Of the waters of Nephtoah. — Jos 15:9.","refs":[["Josh",15,9,15,9]]},{"text":"Of Jezreel. — 1Sa 29:1.","refs":[["1Sam",29,1,29,1]]},{"text":"Of Pisgah. — De 4:49.","refs":[["Deut",4,49,4,49]]},{"text":"Upper and nether springs. — Jos 15:19; Jdj 1:15.","refs":[["Josh",15,19,15,19],["Judg",1,15,1,15]]},{"text":"Of God. — Ps 36:9; Jer 2:13; 17:13.","refs":[["Ps",36,9,36,9],["Jer",2,13,2,13],["Jer",17,13,17,13]]},{"text":"Of Christ. — Zec 13:1.","refs":[["Zech",13,1,13,1]]},{"text":"Of the Holy Spirit. — Joh 7:38,39.","refs":[["John",7,38,7,38],["John",7,39,7,39]]},{"text":"Of constant supplies of grace. — Ps 87:7.","refs":[["Ps",87,7,87,7]]},{"text":"Of eternal life. — Joh 4:14; Re 21:6.","refs":[["John",4,14,4,14],["Rev",21,6,21,6]]},{"text":"Of the means of grace. — Isa 41:18; Joe 3:18.","refs":[["Isa",41,18,41,18],["Joel",3,18,3,18]]},{"text":"Of a good wife. — Pr 5:18.","refs":[["Prov",5,18,5,18]]},{"text":"Of a numerous posterity. — De 33:28.","refs":[["Deut",33,28,33,28]]},{"text":"Of spiritual wisdom. — Pr 16:22; 18:4.","refs":[["Prov",16,22,16,22],["Prov",18,4,18,4]]},{"text":"Of the law of the wise. — Pr 13:14.","refs":[["Prov",13,14,13,14]]},{"text":"Of godly fear. — Pr 14:27.","refs":[["Prov",14,27,14,27]]},{"text":"(Sealed up,) of the church. — Song 4:12.","refs":[["Song",4,12,4,12]]},{"text":"(Not failing,) of the church. — Isa 58:11.","refs":[["Isa",58,11,58,11]]},{"text":"(Always flowing,) of unceasing wickedness of the Jews. — Jer 6:7.","refs":[["Jer",6,7,6,7]]},{"text":"(Corrupt,) of the natural heart. — Jas 3:11; Mt 15:18,19.","refs":[["Jas",3,11,3,11],["Matt",15,18,15,18],["Matt",15,19,15,19]]},{"text":"(Troubled,) of saints led astray. — Pr 25:26.","refs":[["Prov",25,26,25,26]]}],"refCount":53}
